<headline>Mafco Consolidated Group Inc Q4 profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.51		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			128,045		    7,368</p>
