<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q4 net includes pretax gain of $151.7 million on sale of Mafco Worldwide, equal to $112.5 million, or $4.84/shr, after taxes.</p>
<p>1996 year net also includes pretax gain of $127.8 million on Cigar offering, equal to $83.1 million, or $3.58/shr.</p>
<p>Net includes equity in discontinued operations of nil vs $662,000, or $0.03/shr, in quarter and $15.1 million, or $0.65/shr, vs $1.3 million, or $0.06/shr, in year.</p>
